<title>UK: Medeva interim profits sharply ahead.</title>
<headline>Medeva interim profits sharply ahead.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		8.5			vs 7.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.9			vs 1.65</p>
<p> Pretax		     46.0		     vs 33.9</p>
<p> Turnover		   159.0		    vs 129.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range of 44.5 and 52.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Medeva Plc.</p>
</text>
